Package: anyone-rust
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, adduser, procps
Description: Rust client for the Anyone network
 anyone-rust is a command line program for connecting to the Anyone
 network. It runs as a SOCKS proxy.
 .
 You can direct programs to connect through the SOCKS port, and their
 connections are anonymized through the Anyone network.
 .
 The package is built from Arti, the Tor Project's Rust client.
